# Slovak THREE QUARTERS toward the coming hour: "trištvrte na deväť" == 08:45
# (bare_quarter_to + toward_hour_12h; "na" is the toward connector, see
# marker_na.voc).  The same three-quarter form exists in South/East German
# ("dreiviertel neun", de/clock_fraction_45.voc).
# Citation: Slovník súčasného slovenského jazyka (JULS SAV,
# slovnik.juls.savba.sk), s.v. "trištvrte": "trištvrte na osem" == 7.45 h.
trištvrte
trištvrť
